// ReservationFinancials Normalized money block. `totalPrice` is a `number` (NOT a decimal-as-string) — the legacy top-level `totalPrice` string field is kept on the parent for back-compat but is deprecated. `totalPrice` is the GUEST-side stay total (what the guest paid), NOT the host payout.
