	// CancellationPolicy Channel cancellation policy code, verbatim from the reservation. Airbnb codes look like `strict_14_with_grace_period`, `moderate`, `flexible`, `tiered_pricing_non_refundable`; Booking.com reports a numeric policy id. Omitted when the channel did not supply one.
